ImageHive
===================

This repository carries the Swift/MLX port of SenseNova-U1.5 together with its
commit history, and ships a resident local image service on top of it. It is an
independent repository — GitHub records no fork relationship with upstream — and
third-party material it builds on is:

(Its own name was `sensenova-u1` up to release 0.5.2 and is ImageHive from 0.6 on.
Only this repository's own names changed — the upstream port, the upstream
repository and the model artifacts kept theirs.)

1. sensenova-u1-swift — https://github.com/xocialize/sensenova-u1-swift
   Copyright (c) 2026 Xocialize. MIT License (see LICENSE).
   The port is taken from upstream commit 96a0c9b ("publish the pose tiers to
   mlx-community, verified on the downloaded bytes"), the tip of upstream's main
   branch at the time it was taken. Upstream's sources, tests, Package.resolved
   and its own Docs/ (publish/, receipts/) are unchanged.
   The additions of this repository, all under the same MIT terms, are: the resident
   service and MCP front end (Sources/imagehived, Sources/imagehive-mcp),
   the management CLI and installers (cli/, install.sh, uninstall.sh), the build
   and release plumbing (Makefile, scripts/, .github/), and its documentation
   (README, README.en, AGENTS, CHANGELOG, NOTICE, Docs/CLIENTS, Docs/LAYOUT,
   Docs/MODELS, Docs/TROUBLESHOOTING, Docs/DISTRIBUTING + the zh-CN pair).
   Copyright (c) 2026 hrygo.

2. SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT model weights — https://huggingface.co/sensenova/SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT
   Copyright SenseTime. Apache License 2.0. The weights are NOT distributed with
   this repository; install.sh downloads them from ModelScope or Hugging Face at
   the user's request.

3. 8-step distillation LoRA — https://huggingface.co/xocialize/SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT-LoRAs
   Published by Xocialize; downloaded only when a user builds that artifact
   themselves.

4. Pre-converted MLX artifacts — https://huggingface.co/mlx-community
   (mirrored on ModelScope as mlx-community/*). Downloaded, not redistributed.

5. mlx-swift (MIT), swift-transformers (Apache-2.0) and other Swift package
   dependencies are resolved by SwiftPM from their own repositories under the
   terms of their respective licenses; see Package.resolved for the exact pins.

When you redistribute this service, keep this file, LICENSE and the upstream
attribution intact, and point users at the model licenses above — the weights
carry their own terms even though this code is MIT.
